    "html": "<p><img src=\"smamu1.jpg\" align=\"right\" hspace=\"0\" width=\"142\"\nheight=\"175\">This section of the website is dedicated to the Army\nMarksmanship Unit's Pistol Training Guide. Quite simply, this is\nthe &quot;Bible&quot; of Bullseye Pistol Shooting. No one serious\nabout the game of shooting should miss the information in this\nbooklet.</p>\n\n<p>Use the green buttons to the right to navigate through this massive\ntreasure of information.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
